Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.72,0:24:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}（1545年 12月24日 议会）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.50,0:01:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.84,0:02:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}牧师不可结婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will have no married priests.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.40,0:02:25.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 赫福德大人求见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty. My Lord Hertford desires an audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.67,0:02:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赫福德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hertford.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.15,0:02:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 接到传自法国的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty. We have received news from France.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.05,0:02:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨里伯爵于布洛涅旁的圣艾蒂安\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Earl of Surrey, while rashly attacking.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.12,0:02:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}轻率出击法国补给军\N{\fnArial\fs30}French supply forces at Saint-Etienne, just beyond Boulogne,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.52,0:02:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已损兵过六百\N{\fnArial\fs30}has lost over 600 men,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.71,0:02:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}包括军官与士兵在内\N{\fnArial\fs30}as well as all the captains and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.93,0:02:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}出于某种原因 萨里伯爵将他们置于前线\N{\fnArial\fs30}who, for some reason, he had placed in the front line.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.37,0:03:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}各位大人 我从各种渠道听闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lords, I have heard from several sources.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.31,0:03:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}布洛涅战事的惨状\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the calamitous events in Boulogne.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.03,0:03:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听说我方的萨里伯爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems my Lord Surrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.70,0:03:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}与一支庞大的法国护卫队兵戎相见\N{\fnArial\fs30}gave battle to a large convoy of French,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.13,0:03:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并遭遇惨败\N{\fnArial\fs30}and was soundly defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.49,0:03:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}数名军官和麾下士兵阵亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the death of his captains, and most of his gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.76,0:03:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我告诫过他休要莽撞行事 休要将布洛涅\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all of this, despite my warnings not to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.02,0:03:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}置于险境 但他依然充耳不闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}be bold and place Boulogne at risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.73,0:03:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Therefore,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.82,0:03:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已命萨里伯爵回国\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have commanded my Lord Surrey to return here,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.73,0:03:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}接受各位大人对其不当行为的审查\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be examined as to his conduct by Your Lordships.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.81,0:03:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}与此同时\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the meantime,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.63,0:03:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我将任命赫福德大人作为其替任\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will appoint you, my Lord Hertford, as his replacement.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.22,0:03:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你即刻前往布洛涅\N{\fnArial\fs30}You leave at once for Boulogne.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.35,0:03:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同时 因我的秘书莱斯利先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have also decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.37,0:03:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}业绩卓越 才华横溢\N{\fnArial\fs30}for his many great works and talents,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.73,0:04:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我决定委任他大法官一职\N{\fnArial\fs30}to appoint my secretary, Mr. Risley, Lord Chancellor,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.68,0:04:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并授予他莱斯利男爵称号\N{\fnArial\fs30}and to create him Baron Risley.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.05,0:04:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下如此信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am touched…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.89,0:04:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}微臣感怀在心 倍感荣耀\N{\fnArial\fs30}and deeply honored by Your Majesty's trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.84,0:04:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 萨福克公爵有话要讲吗 - 启禀陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My Lord Suffolk? - Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.71,0:04:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有传言说大量法军舰队\N{\fnArial\fs30}there are rumors of a large French fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.18,0:04:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正为作战屯兵整装严阵以待\N{\fnArial\fs30}being assembled and fitted out for war.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.90,0:04:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并且 罗马皇帝已下令在低地国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}So… the Emperor has ordered all English ships and.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.50,0:04:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拘留所有英国船只 没收所有英属财产\N{\fnArial\fs30}properties in the Low Countries to be seized.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.64,0:04:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我方应如何应对\N{\fnArial\fs30}How shall we respond?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.65,0:04:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗马皇帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Emperor…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.41,0:04:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.43,0:04:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我对朋友抱诚守真竭诚相待\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I think of my fidelity to my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.98,0:04:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但他们却都背信弃义言而无信\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all of their betrayals?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.75,0:04:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 舰队正在集结 - 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fleet being amassed… - My Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.73,0:04:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赫福德大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lord Hertford.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.11,0:04:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 赫福德大人 - 阁下有何见教\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My Lord Hertford. - Excellency.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.03,0:04:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能否私下交谈片刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}May we speak a moment, privately?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.90,0:05:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.46,0:05:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看起来在陛下的疆域中\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems, alas, that many things are amiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.78,0:05:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}诸事皆生差池\N{\fnArial\fs30}in His Majesty's kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.86,0:05:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What things?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.68,0:05:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}战事屡战屡败 陛下负债累累\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bad harvest and the burden of His Majesty's debts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.27,0:05:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下的舰队遭疫病之害\N{\fnArial\fs30}The plague among the sailors of His Majesty's fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.92,0:05:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}水手们焦头烂额 溃不成军\N{\fnArial\fs30}with their swollen heads and decayed ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.64,0:05:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阁下 您所言究竟为何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pray, Excellency, what is your point?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.07,0:05:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}由于国王轻率出击布洛涅\N{\fnArial\fs30}The poisoning and the poverty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.64,0:05:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并且无法维持对该地的统领\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the King's realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.02,0:05:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}致使其疆土之上\N{\fnArial\fs30}is in every way due to his rash.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.38,0:05:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哀鸿遍野 民不聊生\N{\fnArial\fs30}and unsustainable occupation of Boulogne…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.11,0:05:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正如大人您所愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}As Your Lordship would want.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.61,0:05:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我极力反对此役 这千真万确\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is true that I argued against the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.95,0:05:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我在激辩中败下阵来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I lost the argument.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.35,0:05:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人 您失之于战\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lost the argument for war, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.32,0:05:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但能取之于和\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can win it for peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.62,0:05:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}力劝国王休要无视箴言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Persuade the King of his folly in hanging on to Boulogne.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.06,0:05:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一意孤行屯兵布洛涅\N{\fnArial\fs30}against all reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.66,0:06:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你我也许能在一定程度上达成一致\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I may come to some agreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.42,0:06:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 大人留步 - 莱斯利先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My Lord. - Mr. Risley.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.75,0:06:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恭贺升迁之喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are to be congratulated.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.14,0:06:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢您 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.94,0:06:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这次升迁突如其来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I confess I find this sudden elevation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.26,0:06:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}实在令我出乎意料\N{\fnArial\fs30}beyond my imagining.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.07,0:06:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非也\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.35,0:06:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这应在您意料之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you must imagine it,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.56,0:06:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并且您应同我等一样喜从中来倍感欢欣\N{\fnArial\fs30}and take great pleasure in it, as we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.72,0:06:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为这必定意味着吾等之大业将蒸蒸日上\N{\fnArial\fs30}For surely, this must mean that our cause is in the ascendancy,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.24,0:06:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下将更加坚定地倾向\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that His Majesty tends ever more firmly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.05,0:06:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正统宗教天主教 反对宗教改革\N{\fnArial\fs30}towards the Orthodox and Catholic persuasion and against Reform.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.19,0:06:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在下相信大人所言非虚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I trust Your Grace is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.15,0:06:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但以在下的浅识薄见来看\N{\fnArial\fs30}But for my own part,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.36,0:06:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王仍反复无常捉摸不定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still find the King so changeable,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.49,0:06:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不知他是否知晓自己的意图\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder if he knows his own mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.10,0:06:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 亨利 - 父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Henry! - Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.12,0:06:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.99,0:06:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能在宫廷见到你真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's good to see you back at Court.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.30,0:06:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很记挂你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.49,0:07:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你记得布丽吉特吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember Brigitte?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.57,0:07:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然 日安 小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, of course! Bonjour, Mademoiselle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.11,0:07:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}日安 亨利 很高兴再次见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bonjour, Henry. I'm very happy to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.43,0:07:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗塞洛小姐现在是我的正式情人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mademoiselle Roussello is now my official mistress.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.85,0:07:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她在宫廷出现令你的母亲公爵夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sorry to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.96,0:07:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}郁郁寡欢 听闻此事我深表遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}her presence at Court makes your mother, the Duchess, unhappy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.14,0:07:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我也无能为力\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there is no help for it,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.47,0:07:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为你的母亲让我很长时间都心灰意冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}for your mother has made me unhappy for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.77,0:07:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 可怜的亨利 - 没事 他年岁已足 应知真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Poor Henry… - No. He's old enough to know the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.96,0:07:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并了解关于爱的其他事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}And guess other things about love.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.51,0:07:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mademoiselle,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.17,0:07:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}若您能令吾父喜逐颜开 吾亦会欢欣展颜\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you make my father happy, then you have also made me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.33,0:07:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}瞧见了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}See?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.47,0:07:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他比外表看起来更成熟睿智\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's older and wiser than he looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.48,0:07:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你也是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}So are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.33,0:07:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错 去畅饮一番\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Drinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.29,0:07:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下圣体可还安康\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is Your Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.53,0:07:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这么告诉你吧 凯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you this, Kate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.74,0:07:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在法征战时我英姿勃发\N{\fnArial\fs30}I felt ten times better in France.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.78,0:07:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}十倍于我往昔\N{\fnArial\fs30}than I have these past years since.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.78,0:08:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我最为痛恨的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I hate above everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.80,0:08:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}便是对事实的曲解\N{\fnArial\fs30}are the interpretations.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.34,0:08:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在宫廷与谁交谈都是一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't seem to matter who I talk to at Court.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.94,0:08:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大使 牧师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ambassadors, clerics,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.26,0:08:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抑或朝臣\N{\fnArial\fs30}courtiers…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.36,0:08:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们都从自己的利益出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}They all interpret the facts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.71,0:08:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}曲解事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}to suit themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.91,0:08:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至于我 上帝知晓 我总是公正而诚实\N{\fnArial\fs30}For myself, God knows I've always spoken with candour and honesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.41,0:08:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但现在我深陷阴谋诡计\N{\fnArial\fs30}But all about me now is guile,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.58,0:08:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虚伪欺诈之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}hypocrisy, and dishonesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.32,0:08:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 我写了本书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty, I have written a book.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.15,0:08:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可否向您展示\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I show it to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.79,0:08:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}书 什么书\N{\fnArial\fs30}A book? What kind of book?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.11,0:08:44.40,Title,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}书名是《一个罪人的耶利米哀歌》\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called Lamentations of a Sinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.40,0:08:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 陛下请看 - 请读献词\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Majesty. - Do read the dedication.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.72,0:08:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}歌颂我最至高无上的君王与夫君\N{\fnArial\fs30}"In praise of my most sovereign lord and husband,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.21,0:08:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亨利八世\N{\fnArial\fs30}"King Henry VIII,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.29,0:09:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他不仅心诚志虔博学多识\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Who is not only godly and learned,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.93,0:09:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且也是我们的先知摩西\N{\fnArial\fs30}"But who is also our Moses,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.01,0:09:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为他将我们从暴君的囚禁\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Since he has delivered us out of the captivity.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.13,0:09:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}与奴役中解放出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}"and bondage of the Pharaoh."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.06,0:09:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是指罗马教皇\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean Rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.57,0:09:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你称教皇的牧师为渣滓\N{\fnArial\fs30}You call the Pope's clergy riffraff,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.98,0:09:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是教皇安插于其暴政之中的眼线\N{\fnArial\fs30}which he planted in his tyranny?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.28,0:09:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并将不尽的感激献给我的王与夫君\N{\fnArial\fs30}"And in eternal gratitude to my Lord and husband,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.94,0:09:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他以卓越功绩向我展示了一条圣洁之路\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Who has shown me by his works a holier path,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.90,0:09:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将我从我盲目无知的信仰中解救出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}"And delivered me from the ignorance of my blind faith."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.47,0:09:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯特 你是当真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kate. Do you mean this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.69,0:09:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错 陛下 并且这不仅是为我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do, Your Majesty. And not just for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.60,0:09:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也是为您所有的国民\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean it for all your subjects.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.57,0:09:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}敬我的夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.61,0:09:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赫伯特女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Herbert.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.86,0:10:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 加德纳主教求见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty. Bishop Gardner is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.42,0:10:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.55,0:10:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我欲逮捕并审问一名已知的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ask permission… to arrest and interrogate a known…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.51,0:10:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}名为安·欧仕培的新教异教徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heretic and Protestant called Anne Askew,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.72,0:10:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因恐其在宫廷有靠山 特请求您的准许\N{\fnArial\fs30}for fear that she has… friends here at Court.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.22,0:10:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人 你已获得我的准许\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have my permission, Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.44,0:10:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}良善的英国臣民\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good English people.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.92,0:10:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们告诉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.27,0:10:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有些人不配\N{\fnArial\fs30}that some of us are not fit to read the words.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.45,0:11:01.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阅读我们救世主的文字\N{\fnArial\fs30}of our Saviour and Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.85,0:11:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我却要说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.65,0:11:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我宁愿阅读圣经上的文字\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would rather read five lines in the Bible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.67,0:11:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也不愿听信寺庙里的惑众妖言\N{\fnArial\fs30}than hear five masses in the temple!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.89,0:11:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}神父声称他能化酒水为上帝之血液\N{\fnArial\fs30}The priest claims to turn the wine into God's blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.87,0:11:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}化杂粮为上帝之躯体\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the bread into God's body!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.90,0:11:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可证据何在\N{\fnArial\fs30}But where is the proof?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.91,0:11:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自己动手一试真伪吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go and find the proof yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.01,0:11:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将面包放在盒子里三个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let the bread lie in the box for three months,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.92,0:11:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它定将腐烂 毫无可取之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it will be mouldy, and so turn to nothing that is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.93,0:11:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.01,0:11:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此我确信 这绝不是上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wherefore, I am persuaded that it cannot be God!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.18,0:11:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}捉住她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arrest that woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.41,0:11:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}信仰为吾之盾牌 愉悦感染吾之心灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Faith is my shield. I now rejoice at heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.09,0:11:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}信念指引吾之所为\N{\fnArial\fs30}and hope bid me do so,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.28,0:11:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}汝当救吾于灾难\N{\fnArial\fs30}for Thou shall take my part and ease me of my woe!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.58,0:11:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}成吾之欢愉\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Thou art my delight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.32,0:11:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}主啊 请勿视之…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No face, Lord, to those who look…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.10,0:11:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨里大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lord Surrey,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.05,0:11:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}据我们所知 你在圣埃蒂安的战败\N{\fnArial\fs30}it has been put to us that your defeat at Saint-Etienne.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.46,0:12:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并非如您所说\N{\fnArial\fs30}was not, as you claimed,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.48,0:12:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当归咎于将士们的无心作战\N{\fnArial\fs30}due to the unwillingness of your soldiers,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.95,0:12:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而是因你个人的愚蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}but to your own folly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.97,0:12:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以及你的莽撞\N{\fnArial\fs30}And an empty confidence in your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.94,0:12:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和盲目的自大\N{\fnArial\fs30}unreasoning bravery.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.24,0:12:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对此指控 你有何辩词\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you answer such a charge?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.31,0:12:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想说 此役并非一败涂地\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would answer it was not such a defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.77,0:12:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其实作战双方都有折损\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was loss and victory on both sides,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.58,0:12:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且\N{\fnArial\fs30}and as a matter of fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.08,0:12:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}敌人的损失其实更为惨重\N{\fnArial\fs30}the enemy took more losses than we.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.10,0:12:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即便如此 大人 我们损失却更令人悲痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even so, my Lord, our loss was the more grievous,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.51,0:12:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们失去了许多将领\N{\fnArial\fs30}since we lost all our captains, who you,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.65,0:12:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只因你不顾风险\N{\fnArial\fs30}regardless of the danger,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.34,0:12:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 将他们派上了前线 - 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- sent into the front line. - Your Grace,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.42,0:12:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想你从未上过战场吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you were never in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.42,0:12:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些军官自愿奔赴前线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those officers wanted to be in the front line.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.99,0:12:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一声令下 他们求之不得\N{\fnArial\fs30}They charged with a cry and with greater courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.45,0:12:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}奋不顾身 奔赴战场\N{\fnArial\fs30}and in as good an order as anyone would wait for.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.03,0:12:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们寡不敌众 却撕开了敌人的防线\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were out numbered, but they broke through the enemy lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.64,0:12:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们击溃了对方五分之四的防御\N{\fnArial\fs30}They destroyed four-fifths of the convoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.56,0:12:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其时 法军已阵脚大乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}At that moment, the French were in disarray,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.78,0:12:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}若非理事会派给我的人中\N{\fnArial\fs30}and if the few men that this council.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.32,0:12:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人临阵退缩\N{\fnArial\fs30}had sent me had not panicked and bolted,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.45,0:12:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那陛下现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}then His Majesty would now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.21,0:13:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}应当已在欢庆一场大捷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}be celebrating a great victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.29,0:13:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是大人 陛下并未迎来胜利\N{\fnArial\fs30}But alas, my Lord, he is not.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.16,0:13:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你以卵击石\N{\fnArial\fs30}You took a risk in attacking an enemy far superior in numbers,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.06,0:13:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}却最终失败\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.03,0:13:12.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你私自逃离战场\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were personally forced to flee the battlefield,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.94,0:13:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}理当受罚\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is reprehensible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.65,0:13:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在三种情况下 你将被剥夺嘉德爵士头衔\N{\fnArial\fs30}And one of only three ways by which a knight companion.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.55,0:13:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这便是其中之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}can be degraded from the Order of the Garter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.55,0:13:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨里大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lord Surrey,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.16,0:13:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我兄弟赫福德大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}my brother, Lord Hertford, has already.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.64,0:13:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已然指控你\N{\fnArial\fs30}announced allegations against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.75,0:13:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在任职布洛涅副将期间\N{\fnArial\fs30}for corrupt misuse of office while.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.52,0:13:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贪污受贿 道德腐败\N{\fnArial\fs30}you were Lieutenant General of Boulogne.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.43,0:13:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他要求立即解除\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has announced an immediate purge on many of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.66,0:13:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在朝中的各项职务\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you appointed to positions of authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.02,0:13:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人 相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.14,0:13:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有无数证人能证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are just too many witnesses that will tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.66,0:13:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亨利·霍华德\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Henry Howard was never corrupted.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.20,0:13:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从未利欲熏心\N{\fnArial\fs30}by personal considerations.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.07,0:13:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 也从未收受过贿赂 - 不管怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nor did his hand ever close upon a bribe. - Nevertheless,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.47,0:13:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}理事会必须解除你的副将一职\N{\fnArial\fs30}this council must confirm your removal as Lieutenant General,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.51,0:13:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同时也将剥夺你布洛涅统领的头衔\N{\fnArial\fs30}as well as revoke your former title, Captain of Boulogne.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.78,0:14:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不可再返回法国\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are ordered not to return to France.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.34,0:14:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure His Majesty will see fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.47,0:14:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一定会收回承命\N{\fnArial\fs30}to countermand these orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.49,0:14:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 只要让我面见于他 - 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- after I have talked with him. - My Lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.48,0:14:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下拒绝召见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Majesty has refused to grant you an audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.24,0:14:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当真\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has he?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.56,0:14:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.93,0:14:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}理查·李希先生求见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir Richard Rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.46,0:14:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}理查先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir Richard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.53,0:14:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 女士 - 您有事相告吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lady Mary. - You have some news?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.16,0:14:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很遗憾的通知您 查普维斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I regret to inform you that Eustace Chapuys,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.56,0:14:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那位曾驻我国的大使\N{\fnArial\fs30}once Imperial Ambassador here, has died,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.33,0:14:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}返回西班牙不久便与世长辞\N{\fnArial\fs30}soon after returning to Spain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.13,0:15:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是位非常卓越的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a remarkable man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.80,0:15:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也是位诚挚的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a true friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.86,0:15:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在我是孤家寡人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And… now I have nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.74,0:15:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Mary…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.04,0:15:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我向您保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me assure you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.41,0:15:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您在宫中仍有挚友相伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you still have many true friends here at Court.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.30,0:15:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至少还有加德纳主教\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not least, Bishop Gardner.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.76,0:15:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}埃德蒙·伯纳 伦敦主教\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Edmund Bonner, Bishop of London, as well as many others.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.55,0:15:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以及众多的天主教徒们\N{\fnArial\fs30}who share the Catholic faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.73,0:15:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们将继续如您般虔诚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who continue to believe as you believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.60,0:15:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你也一样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.14,0:15:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.74,0:16:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可怜的弟弟正被一个异教徒所抚养\N{\fnArial\fs30}My poor brother is being brought up a Protestant and a heretic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.71,0:16:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而陛下却丝毫不加阻拦\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the King does nothing to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.08,0:16:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请放心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be assured,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.46,0:16:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关于此事 我们已有计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}there is work afoot to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.22,0:16:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但加德纳大人必须确认\N{\fnArial\fs30}But my Lord Gardner needs to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.25,0:16:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您支持他的行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}that in these works, he has your support…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.95,0:16:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即使他们也许会伤及您身边的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even though they may touch people close to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.64,0:16:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}代我向大人问好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send my love to His Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.31,0:16:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并转告他 我将为他的成功而祷告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him I will pray fervently for his success.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.64,0:16:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安·殴仕培\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anne Askew.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.60,0:16:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 是的 大人 - 我们听说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, sir. - We hear that you still.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.87,0:16:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你仍在当众宣扬邪教\N{\fnArial\fs30}openly, and in public, preach heresy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.11,0:16:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人 我只是在向那些愿意聆听的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I preach the Word of God, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.70,0:16:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}传达上帝的旨意\N{\fnArial\fs30}To all who will listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.04,0:16:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看来你在宫中有不少朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems you have friends here at Court.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.40,0:17:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过我又想到 你的兄弟曾侍奉过\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then, your brother once served.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.89,0:17:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王的家眷\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the King's household, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.59,0:17:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 是的 大人 - 我们认为你的这些朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, sir. - We think these friends may include.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.70,0:17:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许有些是王后陛下的侍女\N{\fnArial\fs30}some ladies- in- waiting to Her Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.64,0:17:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比如 萨福克公爵夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Duchess of Suffolk, for example.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.54,0:17:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或是王后的姐妹 赫伯特女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or Lady Herbert, the Queen's sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.91,0:17:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们知道你在坐牢期间\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know that you've received monies,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.78,0:17:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}曾收到不少钱 作为救济之用\N{\fnArial\fs30}whilst you've been imprisoned, for your relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.07,0:17:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}We believe…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.65,0:17:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是许多身居要职的女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}That diverse important ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.00,0:17:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给你送的钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}sent you that money.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.03,0:17:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有个身着蓝色制服的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a man in a blue coat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.63,0:17:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给我送了十先令\N{\fnArial\fs30}who delivered me ten shillings.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.55,0:17:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他说了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what did he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.07,0:17:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他说 「是赫福德女士给我的」\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said, "My Lady Hertford sent it to me."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.64,0:17:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是王后许可并支持的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the support and permission of the Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.67,0:17:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}得了吧 欧仕培小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come, come, Mistress Askew!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.82,0:17:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们有办法让你开口\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can make you speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.67,0:18:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}带她去下面的密室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have her moved down one level to the chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.34,0:18:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 大人 我不能… - 照我们说的做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your Grace, I cannot allow… - You will do as we say…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.58,0:18:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}埃德蒙先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir Edmund.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.82,0:18:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.65,0:18:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}求求你 求你 求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Please!Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.35,0:19:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}欧仕培小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mistress Askew.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.22,0:19:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关于布洛涅的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Grace has been badly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.68,0:19:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人您被严重误导了\N{\fnArial\fs30}misinformed as to the events in Boulogne.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.56,0:19:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不置可否 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am very prepared to believe it, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.38,0:19:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}理事会一而再 再而三地拒绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again and again, the Council refused.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.66,0:19:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的增援请求\N{\fnArial\fs30}to send reinforcements that I asked for.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.06,0:19:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}连加来的驻守部队也不肯帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even the garrison at Calais refused to help,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.82,0:19:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只派了几名笨手笨脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}except to send some flat-footed,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.01,0:19:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}眼歪嘴斜的笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}squint-eyed, unshapely men unfit to carry arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.63,0:19:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在 我被剥夺了指挥权\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, my command is revoked.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.52,0:19:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是废人一名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I am a man of no service.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.73,0:19:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无计可施\N{\fnArial\fs30}No activity.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.50,0:19:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还被软禁在家中\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I must sit at home within the walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.70,0:19:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这并非世界末日 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not think of this as the end of your life, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.39,0:19:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝给了您优雅 勇气 和广阔的胸怀\N{\fnArial\fs30}God has given you grace, courage, liberality.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.67,0:19:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}圣埃蒂安一役后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And after Saint-Etienne,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.42,0:19:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他又赐给了您好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}He also gave you good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.00,0:19:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}幸运之神不过是暂时走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luck deserted you for a moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.78,0:19:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但如果一切顺利\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if the rest go on,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.27,0:19:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您很快会再次为陛下效力\N{\fnArial\fs30}then you will soon serve the King's Majesty again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.32,0:20:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}完全可以重建声威\N{\fnArial\fs30}And have every chance to regain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.24,0:20:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}重现昔日荣耀\N{\fnArial\fs30}your honor and reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.87,0:20:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}多谢公爵吉言\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thank your Grace for your words,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.82,0:20:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但事实是 我一开始于布洛涅带兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the truth of it is, I was undermined.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.92,0:20:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就已遭人陷害 受到攻讦\N{\fnArial\fs30}and attacked from the start of my command in Boulogne.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.58,0:20:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如今 我敢发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, I swear to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.90,0:20:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赫福德恨不得取代我的地位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hertford will smart for usurping my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.90,0:20:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我奉劝大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would counsel Your Lordship.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.87,0:20:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要与赫福德为敌\N{\fnArial\fs30}not to raise arms against Hertford.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.99,0:20:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't the choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.47,0:20:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公爵 国王撑不到王子成人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Grace, it's sure the King will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.88,0:20:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此事确定无疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}before the Prince reaches his maturity.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.65,0:20:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么 将由何人辅佐王子\N{\fnArial\fs30}So who will then govern the Prince…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.53,0:20:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}摄政监国呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the realm?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.69,0:20:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}做做样子就好 看在上帝份儿上 小惩就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just pinch her, for God's sake. Just pinch her that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.87,0:20:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别施以酷刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.20,0:21:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们再问你一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ask you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.50,0:21:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}王后的哪位侍女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which of the ladies of Her Majesty's chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.08,0:21:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对你赠送钱财 并承诺会释放你\N{\fnArial\fs30}sent you monies or promises of relief?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.98,0:21:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说 王后的哪个侍女\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want to know which of the Queen's Ladies share.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.68,0:21:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是你的同党\N{\fnArial\fs30}your beliefs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.70,0:21:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抑或就是王后本人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or if the Queen herself does.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.81,0:21:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 不见棺材不落泪 - 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We must stretch her further. - My Lords!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.29,0:21:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对女人用刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is absolutely against the King's Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.02,0:21:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这绝对有违国法\N{\fnArial\fs30}to rack a woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.95,0:21:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吾心不忍 不会再继续用刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I will do it no further on my conscience.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.04,0:21:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别激动 埃德蒙大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come, come, Sir Edmund.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.23,0:21:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你很清楚 我们得国王授权\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know perfectly well we have the authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.30,0:21:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 对她进行审讯 - 陛下会允许你们这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- of the King himself to examine her. - I do not know at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.23,0:21:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恕我不予苟同\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you have His Majesty's permission for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.21,0:21:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.79,0:21:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你这个蠢女人 我问问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You foolish woman. Let me ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.36,0:22:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你认为牧师无法塑造耶稣之身？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you say that priests cannot make the body of Christ?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.21,0:22:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say so, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.96,0:22:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只听过上帝创造人\N{\fnArial\fs30}For I have read that God made man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.67,0:22:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但人能塑造上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that man can make God,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.81,0:22:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我至今未曾听说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have never yet read.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.94,0:22:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么祝圣仪式举行后 也不是耶稣之身吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And after the consecration, is it not the body of Christ?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.32,0:22:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不过是献祭的面包罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. It is but consecrated bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.12,0:22:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果祝圣仪式后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what if a mouse eats it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.92,0:22:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那东西被老鼠吃了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}after the consecration?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.47,0:22:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那老鼠会变成什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What shall become of that mouse?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.39,0:22:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你认为呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What say you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.45,0:22:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}愚蠢的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stupid woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.67,0:22:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得这只老鼠死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say that mouse is damned.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.44,0:22:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可怜的老鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor mouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.47,0:23:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 何事 - 启禀陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is it? - Your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.38,0:23:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安·欧仕培小姐被无情用刑折磨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must tell you that the woman Anne Askew.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.18,0:23:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这绝对是对陛下所制定\N{\fnArial\fs30}has been put to torture in absolute violation.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.84,0:23:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}法律的藐视\N{\fnArial\fs30}of Your Majesty's laws.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.21,0:23:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你能来找我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right to come and see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.55,0:23:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如此我便能让你的良心不再内疚\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I may explain to you, and ease your conscience.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.52,0:23:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}若为极端异教\N{\fnArial\fs30}In cases of extreme heresy,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.12,0:24:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}法律并未对男女处罚之别作出规定\N{\fnArial\fs30}the law makes no distinction between a man and a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.89,0:24:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}埃德蒙先生 你该知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}For as you know, Sir Edmund,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.02,0:24:07.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}魔鬼披着各种外衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}the devil takes many forms.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.39,0:24:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}令人防不胜防\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet, it is always the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.90,0:24:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up. Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.08,0:24:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}王后的事 我们再问你一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}We desire to ask you again about the Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.72,0:24:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.71,0:24:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak, lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.33,0:24:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王驾到\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Majesty, the King!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.53,0:25:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的议员们\N{\fnArial\fs30}My well-beloved Commons,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.70,0:25:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我今日前来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I come here today to speak with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.68,0:25:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对你们阐述心中所想\N{\fnArial\fs30}to set forth my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.05,0:25:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也对大家敞开心扉\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the secrets of my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.44,0:25:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个国家本该纯真有爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}There should be perfect love.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.59,0:25:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和谐和睦 但是如今\N{\fnArial\fs30}and concord in this realm. But instead,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.38,0:25:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}却纷争不断 争论不休\N{\fnArial\fs30}there is discord and dissention in every place.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.49,0:25:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在神职人员中 充斥着异教徒和再浸礼教徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}What love and charity is there amongst the clergy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.38,0:25:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有天主教徒和伪君子 他们彼此攻击 互不相让\N{\fnArial\fs30}when one calls the other heretic and Anabaptist?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.78,0:25:49.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}何来关爱和仁慈可言\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the other calls him Papist and hypocrite?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.97,0:25:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是你们所谓的仁慈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are these tokens of charity amongst you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.33,0:25:56.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是你们所谓的手足之爱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are these the signs of fraternal love?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.69,0:26:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人们向往光明\N{\fnArial\fs30}The people look for light.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.00,0:26:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而你们令他们陷入黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you bring them darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.76,0:26:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至于普通信徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}And as for the laity,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.02,0:26:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们的心也被恶意和嫉妒占据\N{\fnArial\fs30}you are not clean of malice and envy,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.04,0:26:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}毁谤责难牧师和主教\N{\fnArial\fs30}for you slander and rebuke priests and bishops.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.35,0:26:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们以一己之见\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take it upon yourself to judge the clergy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.10,0:26:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}靠不切实际的想法和徒劳的解释来\N{\fnArial\fs30}by the sole light of your fantastical opinions.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.31,0:26:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}论断神职人员\N{\fnArial\fs30}and vain expositions.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.45,0:26:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虽然人人可读圣经\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although you are permitted to read Holy Scripture,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.44,0:26:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你们必须清楚 当在许可范围内\N{\fnArial\fs30}you must understand that it is under license.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.40,0:26:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并且要对得起自己的良心\N{\fnArial\fs30}and only to inform your conscience.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.51,0:26:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而不是制造争端 曲解圣经\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to dispute and make scripture.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.38,0:26:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们对圣经可以有自己的理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave you the Bible in your own tongue,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.43,0:26:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但很遗憾 这件最珍贵的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I am sorry to see that most precious jewel,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.61,0:26:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝之言\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Word of God,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.46,0:26:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这个国家的各个酒肆客栈\N{\fnArial\fs30}has been disputed, rhymed,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.40,0:26:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被质疑 被改写传唱 人们大吵大闹\N{\fnArial\fs30}sung and jangled in every alehouse and every tavern in this realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.16,0:26:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}本人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.93,0:26:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}作为上帝指定的教皇\N{\fnArial\fs30}whom God has appointed his Vicar here,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.49,0:26:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不愿再见到这种纷争\N{\fnArial\fs30}will see these divisions extinct,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.91,0:27:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希望那些暴行得到修正\N{\fnArial\fs30}and those enormities corrected.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.71,0:27:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不然 上帝讲视我为无用的仆人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or God shall account me an unprofitable servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.08,0:27:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Therefore…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.72,0:27:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大家应当 宽厚待人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be of charity with one another,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.48,0:27:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲如兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}like brother and brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.36,0:27:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}作为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.94,0:27:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们至高无上的君主 我劝诫你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}dread, and serve God, to which I, as your supreme head,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.86,0:27:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要敬爱上帝 畏惧上帝 侍奉上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}and sovereign Lord exhort and require you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.21,0:27:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我此前所言之仁爱友善\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I doubt not, but that love and affinity which.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.63,0:27:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将永存于世 永不消亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I spoke of at the beginning shall never be dissolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.97,0:27:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我确信无疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}or broken between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.05,0:28:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王所言何事 托马斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did the King say, Sir Thomas?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.78,0:28:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他震怒于国内宗教分裂之事\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was angry with the religious divisions in his realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.61,0:28:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他说允许人们解读圣经\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said that he gave people the Bible to read,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.01,0:28:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并非让人任意曲解其意\N{\fnArial\fs30}but not so that they could dispute its meanings.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.72,0:28:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对我来说 陛下的举动就好似\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems to me like His Majesty is like one.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.45,0:28:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将一个人掷出高塔 在他坠落之时\N{\fnArial\fs30}who would throw a man headlong off the top of a high tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.47,0:28:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}却要求他中途停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}and ask him to stop when he is halfway down.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.58,0:28:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以肯定的是 宣扬罗马暴政及盲目的信仰\N{\fnArial\fs30}But surely, our delivery from the tyranny of Rome and blind faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.61,0:28:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不会是改革以及\N{\fnArial\fs30}is not the end of the Reform.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.45,0:28:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}基督徒复兴的结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the renewal of our Christian life,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.18,0:28:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而仅仅是个开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it is only the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.48,0:28:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王确实认为他是唯一了解上帝意志的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The King does suppose that only he knows the Will of God,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.41,0:28:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以 虽然不切实际\N{\fnArial\fs30}and so whatever he thinks should therefore be the new Orthodoxy,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.67,0:28:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的想法即为新的正教\N{\fnArial\fs30}however fantastical.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.54,0:28:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}仿佛他的个人宗教信仰一般\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is like his own private religion.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.58,0:28:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}另外 他要求仁爱和宽厚\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet, he asks for an end to division for charity and love.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.96,0:29:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托马斯先生 他仍旧是国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir Thomas, he is still the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.55,0:29:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}若他提出仁爱和宽厚\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if he asks for charity and love,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.86,0:29:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么他就是在执行上帝的意愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}then he is doing no more than Christ did.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.87,0:29:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 国王已经打开了潘多拉的盒子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam, the King has opened a Pandora's Box.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.06,0:29:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管他愿意与否\N{\fnArial\fs30}And whether he will or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.11,0:29:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱怨几多 盒子一旦打开 便再难合上\N{\fnArial\fs30}he simply cannot close it now, whatever his complaints.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.44,0:29:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你有心事 在担心什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look troubled. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.37,0:29:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从未像现在这般担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fear now, more than ever, the machinations of men.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.84,0:29:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小人的阴谋诡计 将会如何影响朝廷和国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}How their plots and plans swirl about the Court and the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.51,0:29:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我能觉察得到 却心有余而力不足\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can sense it, but I have no knowledge anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.85,0:29:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除了国王 似乎所有人都疏远于我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one, it seems, least of all the King, confides in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.47,0:29:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样不好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But is it not better so?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.30,0:29:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有利有弊\N{\fnArial\fs30}In some ways,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.71,0:29:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有更多时间陪伴你\N{\fnArial\fs30}since it leaves me free to love you at my leisure.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.86,0:29:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但话说回来 这也让我能远离政务\N{\fnArial\fs30}But in other ways, it condemns my high station.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.30,0:29:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}特别是现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}to neglect affairs of the realm, especially now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.83,0:29:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小人用阴谋保障将来和他们的利益\N{\fnArial\fs30}Men conspire to secure his future, and their own profit.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.52,0:29:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.44,0:29:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如何保障将来\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can they secure the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.78,0:30:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把王子当做傀儡\N{\fnArial\fs30}By controlling the Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.88,0:30:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大家都认为国王的健康每况愈下\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's widely supposed that the King's infirmities grow worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.54,0:30:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从而无法活着看到王子成年\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he will not live to see the Prince come to maturity.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.08,0:30:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还爱着国王吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you still love the King?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.27,0:30:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 赫福德大人 - 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My Lord Hertford. - Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.43,0:30:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}法兰西那边情况如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}So. There is peace with France.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.07,0:30:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王陛下只有接受合约\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only if Your Majesty accepts the terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.50,0:30:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么合约\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are the terms?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.05,0:30:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下必须在八年内\N{\fnArial\fs30}In 8 years' time,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.45,0:30:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}归还布洛涅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty will hand back Boulogne.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.67,0:30:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}法国方面会支付两百万克朗\N{\fnArial\fs30}In return… for a payment of 2 million crowns.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.40,0:30:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 两百万 - 是的 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 2 million? - Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.09,0:31:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}法国统帅 克劳德·达奈博\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Admiral of France, Claude d'Annibault,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.59,0:31:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会亲自前来宫廷签署合约\N{\fnArial\fs30}will come here to Your Majesty's court to sign the peace treaty.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.70,0:31:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果国王陛下首肯\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Your Majesty so desires.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.02,0:31:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.95,0:31:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}干得不错 赫福德大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've done well, my Lord Hertford.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.29,0:31:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.63,0:31:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 大人 - 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My Lord. - Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.63,0:31:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}加德纳主教大人审问了安·欧仕培 那个异教徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Grace, Bishop Gardner, having examined the heretic Anne Askew,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.56,0:31:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}特此前来得到陛下允许\N{\fnArial\fs30}requests Your Majesty's permission to order the arrests of three.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.84,0:31:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以逮捕王后陛下的三位侍女\N{\fnArial\fs30}of Her Majesty's ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.49,0:31:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其中包括她的妹妹 赫伯特女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Including Her Majesty's sister, lady Herbert.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.72,0:31:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}主教大人须就她们私藏禁书\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Grace would like to question them as to their knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.31,0:31:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和异端思想 对其进行询问\N{\fnArial\fs30}and keeping of forbidden materials.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.83,0:32:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.46,0:32:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 守住门口 - 是 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stay at the door. - Yes, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.33,0:32:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.48,0:32:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 大人 - 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My Lord. - My Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.01,0:32:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是一项伟大的事业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here is a very great undertaking,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.24,0:32:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你我的命运都悬于此\N{\fnArial\fs30}upon which our lives will depend.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.59,0:32:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我们首先必须决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what we must first decide is.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.79,0:32:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}接近温莎的最佳途径\N{\fnArial\fs30}how best to approach Windsor…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.11,0:32:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并击退保护王子的守卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}and in what manner to overcome the guards that surround the Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.42,0:32:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}接着我们带走王子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so, remove him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.70,0:32:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}毫无疑问 先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}For, be in no doubt, gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.02,0:32:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要控制了王位继承人\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he who possesses the heir to the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.21,0:32:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么王位也就不在话下\N{\fnArial\fs30}will very soon possess the throne itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.66,0:33:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}王后陛下驾到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her Majesty, the Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.67,0:33:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 莱斯利大人 - 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My Lord Risley. - Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.80,0:33:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 主教大人 - 王后陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your Grace. - Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.92,0:33:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我能跳舞吗 - 当然了 我的好小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}- May I dance? - Of course you may, my Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.60,0:33:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 陛下 - 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your Majesty. - Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.82,0:33:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 王后陛下 - 赫福德大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your Majesty. - My Lord Hertford.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.12,0:33:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}见您从法国归来 我倍感欣喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am most glad to see you returned from France.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.11,0:33:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.38,0:33:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}加德纳主教逮捕了我妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bishop Gardner has arrested my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.50,0:33:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有两名侍女 怀疑她们是异教徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}and two of my ladies on suspicion of heresy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.13,0:33:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 主教大人 - 玛丽公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your Grace. - Lady Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.49,0:34:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的调查进展如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}How go your investigations?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.80,0:34:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一切顺利\N{\fnArial\fs30}They go well.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.83,0:34:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们在王后侍女的橱柜内\N{\fnArial\fs30}For we have discovered certain books.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.63,0:34:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发现了几本异端邪说书籍\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the closets of the Queen's ladies,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.23,0:34:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}之后会对她们进一步问讯\N{\fnArial\fs30}about which they will be questioned further.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.69,0:34:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个异教徒 安·欧仕培呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the heretic, Anne Askew?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.81,0:34:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很高兴地告诉您 玛丽公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, well I'm happy to tell, good lady,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.70,0:34:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王陛下下令\N{\fnArial\fs30}that on His Majesty's orders, she is condemned.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.70,0:34:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她将在伦敦肉市场被处以火刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be burned at Smithfield.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.42,0:34:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}逮捕他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seize him!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.62,0:34:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨里大人 你以叛国罪被捕\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lord Surrey, you are under arrest for treason.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.84,0:34:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}新鲜好吃的肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweetmeats. Fresh meats!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.97,0:34:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走过路过不要错过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on in, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.11,0:35:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 这位先生 - 你有何事 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sir. Sir. - What does he want, my Lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.74,0:35:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.98,0:35:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把这个绑在她脖子上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tie this around her neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.15,0:35:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好让她早点解脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will end her suffering quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.90,0:35:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.99,0:35:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不止看在钱的份上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not just for the money,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.38,0:35:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还为了上帝的仁爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}But also for the love of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.37,0:36:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赫福德夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lady Hertford.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.90,0:36:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有何贵干\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.38,0:36:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是前来通知 加德纳主教要见您\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just to let you know that Bishop Gardner would like to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.06,0:36:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}越快越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.61,0:36:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.12,0:36:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}火药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gunpowder.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.84,0:36:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个朋友的礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gift from a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.86,0:37:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨里大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lord Surrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.93,0:37:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}若是国王驾崩\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the King should die,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.77,0:37:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}年幼的王子无力执掌朝政\N{\fnArial\fs30}leaving the Lord Prince at his tender age, have you either.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.59,0:37:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是否有策划或暗示过 摄政的人选呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}devised or suggested who should govern him in this realm?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.69,0:37:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无论怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whether that is,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.98,0:37:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在此种情形下\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have ever said that in such a case,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.41,0:37:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是否说过由自己来摄政\N{\fnArial\fs30}you would have the rule and governance of him?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.11,0:37:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抑或是相似的话语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or words to that effect?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.47,0:37:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 奈维特表弟 我明白你的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, yes, cousin Knyvit. I understood the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.31,0:37:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有 你是否蓄意佩戴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also, is it true that you willfully bear the Royal Arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.54,0:37:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}忏悔者爱德华国王的王家纹章\N{\fnArial\fs30}of King Edward the Confessor?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.52,0:37:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并声称自己是他的继任或亲属\N{\fnArial\fs30}And claim to be the next heir or kin to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.79,0:38:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以我的身份和血统 我确有这个权力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only put in my coat of arms what I am entitled to put there,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.76,0:38:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}理查德爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir Richard.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.37,0:38:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我来告诉你吧 萨里大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you this, my Lord Surrey,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.21,0:38:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}若是你的确掌握权力\N{\fnArial\fs30}if ever you got power here, in this realm,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.83,0:38:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我便会选择离开此地\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would go abroad and stay there.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.06,0:38:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我是如此惧怕于你的怨念\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I would be so afraid of your malice.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.71,0:38:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}奈维特表弟 我的怨念不在于你如此卑微之徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cousin Knyvit, I am maliced not so low as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.51,0:38:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而是在于身居高位之人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My malice goes much higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.86,0:38:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他说他怨恨身居高位之人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said his malice went even higher?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.15,0:38:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.95,0:38:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}据线报称 萨里和他的党徒们的目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My informants tell me that it was the intention of Surrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.01,0:38:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在于谋杀议会所有成员\N{\fnArial\fs30}and his associates to usurp authority by means of the murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.56,0:38:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并以此进行篡位\N{\fnArial\fs30}of all members of the Council,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.26,0:38:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}由他们掌控王子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the control of the Prince by them alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.89,0:38:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}居然如此用心险恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}God forbid they should have succeeded.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.67,0:38:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 天诛地灭 - 陛下所言极是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- in their abominable enterprise! - Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.18,0:38:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝保佑 我们及时发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank God the whole was found out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.13,0:38:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我过去如此爱他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to love him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.68,0:39:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我深知他骄傲而愚蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I've always known he was proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.68,0:39:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我并不在意 依然这么爱他\N{\fnArial\fs30}and foolish. But I loved him for all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.13,0:39:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但他却辜负了我的爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now he has forfeited my love.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.01,0:39:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 马丁 - 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Martin. - My Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.73,0:39:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 带匕首了吗 - 是的 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you get the dagger? - Yes, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.51,0:39:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.20,0:39:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.41,0:40:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下面是条河\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.70,0:40:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}涨潮时分会涌上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It comes right up at high tide.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.82,0:40:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我正好能从这个井里跳下去 我确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can just about fit down the shaft, I'm certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.68,0:40:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走吧 到圣凯瑟琳码头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go now, to St. Catherine's dock,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.31,0:40:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}弄一艘船 在那儿等我\N{\fnArial\fs30}get a boat. Wait for me there.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.81,0:40:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我午夜时分应该能到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should be with you by midnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.28,0:40:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看在上帝份上 马丁 要是我没能成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the love of God, Martin, do as I ask,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.95,0:40:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 就照我说的做 - 是 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- for if I do not escape from this place… - Yes, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.82,0:40:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}妹妹 过来 别哭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sister. There, there! Weep no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.61,0:40:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你被释放了 他们没有证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were released! Nothing has been found.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.35,0:40:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一切都会好起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything is going to be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.80,0:41:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.77,0:41:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一切都会好起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything is going to be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.81,0:41:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的安 你没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darling Anne, you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.81,0:41:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.43,0:41:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.32,0:41:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他要逃跑 快来人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's escaping! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.80,0:42:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}诸位大人 陪审团成员\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lords, members of the jury.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.40,0:42:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伯爵犯下的诸多罪行\N{\fnArial\fs30}For either of the offenses the Earl has committed,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.91,0:42:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}理应死罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}he deserves death.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.29,0:42:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}首先 肆意佩戴王家纹章\N{\fnArial\fs30}First, for usurping the Royal Arms,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.40,0:42:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并有篡夺王位之嫌\N{\fnArial\fs30}which gives rise to the suspicion that he hoped to become King.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.48,0:42:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其次 他企图越狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other, for escaping from prison,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.92,0:42:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 恰恰证明他心里有鬼 - 你错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- whereby he proved his guilt. - You are false!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.37,0:42:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}见钱眼开 甚至能出卖自己的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to earn a piece of gold, would condemn your own father!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.81,0:42:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从未试图盗取王家纹章\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never sought to usurp the King's Arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.41,0:42:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}众所周知 我的祖先们本来就有\N{\fnArial\fs30}For everyone knows my ancestors bore them!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.20,0:42:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去诺福克的教堂吧 你自然会看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to the church in Norfolk. You will see them there.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.87,0:42:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}五百年来 一直如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}For they have been ours for 500 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.79,0:42:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}注意你的言辞 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold your peace, my Lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.38,0:42:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你是意图叛国和篡夺王位 - 那你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your idea was to commit treason and become King! - And you!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.19,0:42:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尔等鼠辈\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cats pole!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.55,0:43:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你有什么资格出此狂言\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you to do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.58,0:43:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还是给我闭上嘴吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had better hold your tongue!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.79,0:43:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自从国王在朝廷中任用尔等奸佞小人\N{\fnArial\fs30}For this kingdom has never been well since the King put.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.94,0:43:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}英格兰就一直鸡飞狗跳 民不聊生\N{\fnArial\fs30}mean creatures like you into this government!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.56,0:43:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}法庭上请保持肃静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Silence in court!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.89,0:43:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}肃静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.58,0:43:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}假若如你所说 指控并不属实\N{\fnArial\fs30}If, as you say, the accusations are false,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.95,0:43:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可否解释 为何企图逃离伦敦塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}can you explain to us why you tried to escape the Tower?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.19,0:43:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我当时就是为避免\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to escape to prevent myself from.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.84,0:43:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陷入此种境地\N{\fnArial\fs30}coming to the pass in which I am now.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.46,0:43:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至于你 大人 当然心知肚明\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you, my Lord, well know.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.41,0:43:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人非圣贤 孰能无过\N{\fnArial\fs30}that no matter how right a man may be,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.51,0:43:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}欲加之罪 何患无辞\N{\fnArial\fs30}they always find the fallen one guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.95,0:43:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你落得今日之田地 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have only yourself to blame, my Lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.95,0:43:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 怨不得别人 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- for the pass you're in. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.54,0:44:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是朋友变敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a friendly foe.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.19,0:44:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}善意得恶报\N{\fnArial\fs30}My shadow of good will.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.79,0:44:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁能料到老伙计和好朋友会设计害我\N{\fnArial\fs30}My old companion and dear friend that trapped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.89,0:44:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 亨利·霍华德 请作最后陈述 - 无罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Henry Howard. How do you plead? - Not guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.99,0:44:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凭据何在\N{\fnArial\fs30}How will you be tried?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.26,0:44:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}苍天可鉴 国民为证\N{\fnArial\fs30}By God, and the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.54,0:44:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我确实憎恨伯爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew that I hated the Earl.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.65,0:44:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但令我惊讶的是 理查德爵士 你也如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I am surprised, Sir Richard, that you share my antipathy.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.20,0:44:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赫福德大人 没必要如此惊讶\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lord Hertford, you should not be so surprised,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.51,0:45:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为伯爵同样憎恨我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}since the Earl hates us both the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.22,0:45:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以我肯定…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I am sure…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.78,0:45:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}解决掉他 对你我都大有裨益\N{\fnArial\fs30}all of us will prosper better without him.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.56,0:45:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我赞同\N{\fnArial\fs30}I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.69,0:45:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人们 打扰了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lords, forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.55,0:45:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}身为陪审团主席 我有必要告诉各位大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But as foreman of the jury, I have to tell your Lordships.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.40,0:45:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}控告萨里大人谋反一案 证据不足\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we are not impressed with the evidence against my Lord Surrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.85,0:45:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们都很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is very clear to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.98,0:45:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨里大人有权佩戴\N{\fnArial\fs30}that my Lord Surrey has the right to bear the arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.30,0:45:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}忏悔者爱德华的纹章 至于谋反一事\N{\fnArial\fs30}of Edward the Confessor. And as to the plot against His Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.82,0:45:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尚无可靠的证据支持\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can find no credible evidence to support it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.79,0:45:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sirs…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.20,0:45:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们一致认为 伯爵因此等琐事遭受指控\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do not think it right and proper that the Earl should.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.91,0:45:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}实在是不该\N{\fnArial\fs30}be condemned for such… trifles.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.57,0:45:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克里斯托弗阁下 既然国王已经认定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir Christopher, whenever has innocence.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.44,0:45:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他应该以死谢天下\N{\fnArial\fs30}been cause to save a man's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.80,0:45:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他还能借口清白无辜 从而死里逃生吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}when the King deems him unfit to live in the Commonwealth?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.56,0:45:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人 这是基于律法的审判\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lord. This is a trial under law.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.77,0:45:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}海登大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Hayden,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.48,0:45:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}假如你并不清楚 那么我来告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you did not know it before, then you know it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.52,0:46:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所谓律法也就是陛下的意愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}The law is whatever His Majesty says it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.57,0:46:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你惹恼了陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you provoke His Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.38,0:46:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你也会吃不了兜着走\N{\fnArial\fs30}then you, too, will feel the full force of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.73,0:46:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么了 玛丽公主 不舒服吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is wrong, Lady Mary? Are you unwell?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.27,0:46:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.10,0:46:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是为何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.78,0:46:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我听闻一些流言\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have heard some rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.31,0:46:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关于何事 玛丽公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rumors about what, Lady Mary?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.25,0:46:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}新上任的罗马帝国大使告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The new Imperial Ambassador has told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.90,0:46:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在安特卫普以及国外有传言说\N{\fnArial\fs30}that in Antwerp and in other foreign places,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.39,0:47:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王正在物色新的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}that they are saying the King is looking for a new wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.58,0:47:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们为何这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why should they say so?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.74,0:47:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们结婚已有时日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Despite the length of your marriage,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.65,0:47:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你却未给陛下添丁\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have still not presented His Majesty with a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.17,0:47:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.48,0:47:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们曾亲密无间 你还记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were such good friends. You remember that, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.36,0:47:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对我而言 一切都没变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, for me, nothing has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.18,0:47:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我爱你 一如既往\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I love you, as I did before.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.53,0:47:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过 世事变迁\N{\fnArial\fs30}But something has happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.15,0:47:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你对我已大不如从前\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you no longer love me as you did before.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.16,0:47:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.06,0:47:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陪审团的诸位先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen of the jury,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.43,0:47:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请你们陈述审判意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}how do you find the defendant?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.18,0:48:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guilty!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.72,0:48:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他要以死谢罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he should die for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.57,0:48:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们凭什么判断我有罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of what have you found me guilty?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.89,0:48:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很显然 你们没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surely, there is no law.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.56,0:48:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}法律依据 但我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}that justifies you. But I know the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.52,0:48:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王想铲除身边所有的贵族\N{\fnArial\fs30}wants to get rid of all the noble blood around him.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.44,0:48:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只用低贱之人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And employ none but low people.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.90,0:48:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 无罪 - 判决造假\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not guilty! - This trial is a sham!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.57,0:48:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 真差劲 - 亨利·霍华德\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No chop, chop! - Henry Howard…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.33,0:48:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}释放他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Release him!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.18,0:48:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你被判遣返原籍\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will be taken to the place from whence you came,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.16,0:48:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在伦敦游街示众\N{\fnArial\fs30}and there, to be dragged through the city of London.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.85,0:49:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}押至泰伯恩受刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}unto the place of execution called Tyburn!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.00,0:49:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先受绞刑 待濒死之时\N{\fnArial\fs30}There, to be hanged, cut down while still alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.36,0:49:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阉其下体 剜其五脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}your privy parts cut off, and your bowels taken out.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.08,0:49:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}焚烤其身\N{\fnArial\fs30}of your body and burned before you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.60,0:49:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}斩其首级 大卸四块\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your head cut off, and your body divided into four parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.71,0:49:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}碎尸置于何处\N{\fnArial\fs30}The head and the quarters to be set at such places.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.82,0:49:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将由国王指定\N{\fnArial\fs30}as the King shall assign.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.29,0:49:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王在哪里 这完全是乱来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the King? This is a travesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.97,0:49:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所谓乐活便是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The happy life be these:
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.14,0:49:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}心静如止水\N{\fnArial\fs30}The quiet mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.81,0:49:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}君子坦荡荡\N{\fnArial\fs30}the equal friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.13,0:49:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小人长戚戚\N{\fnArial\fs30}no grudge, no strife,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.32,0:50:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大智从率直\N{\fnArial\fs30}wisdom joined with simplicity,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.63,0:50:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}长夜无愁绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}the night discharged of all care.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.23,0:50:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the King?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.36,0:50:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 谢谢 莱斯利大人 - 逆贼未能得逞\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you, lord Risley. - The King is saved from conspirators.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.66,0:50:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至于安·欧仕培…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Anne Askew…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.91,0:50:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}宝贝 我听说你近来钻进了书堆里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweetheart? I hear you've been busying yourself with your books.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.51,0:50:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.42,0:50:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我翻译了伊拉斯谟的著作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have translated works by Erasmus,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.21,0:50:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还买了一本好书 托马斯·贝莱特的圣咏集\N{\fnArial\fs30}as well as buying a beautiful book of psalms by Thomas Berthelet.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.75,0:50:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很惊讶 凯特 你竟如此勤奋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder, Kate, at your diligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.62,0:50:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我视其为责任 同时也感到荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I regard it as much my duty as my pleasure,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.75,0:50:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能将如此好书\N{\fnArial\fs30}to place such wonderful books.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.13,0:50:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}献给善良的英国人民 长久以来\N{\fnArial\fs30}before the good English people who have been a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.25,0:51:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们一直渴望着来自圣经的\N{\fnArial\fs30}thirsting and hungering for the sincere.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.12,0:51:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真知灼见 金玉良言\N{\fnArial\fs30}and plain knowledge of God's Word.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.00,0:51:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小心为上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just be cautious.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.60,0:51:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并非每个英国人都能阅读并理解福音书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not every English person can read or understand the Gospels.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.41,0:51:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此事产生的影响难以预料\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you are to be careful of the consequences.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.35,0:51:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 须谨慎对待 - 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- of encouraging them to try. - Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.43,0:51:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不惧怕福音书 谁都不应该如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not afraid of the Gospels, nor should anyone be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.91,0:51:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下着手肃清来自罗马的荒谬信仰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty has begun a great work in banishing.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.32,0:51:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}实乃丰功伟业\N{\fnArial\fs30}the monstrous idol of Rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.82,0:51:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如今有神相助\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now with God's help,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.82,0:51:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您定能彻底清除\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can finish that work.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.22,0:51:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}英国教会的余孽\N{\fnArial\fs30}by purging the Church of England of its dregs.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.89,0:51:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 陛下 - 抱歉 我累了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Majesty… - Forgive me. I am tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.38,0:52:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告退 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.34,0:52:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kate.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.08,0:52:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 告退 陛下 - 告退 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your Majesty. - Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.41,0:52:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 告退 陛下 - 告退 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Majesty. - Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.79,0:52:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 告退 陛下 - 告退 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Majesty. - Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.55,0:52:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告退 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.33,0:52:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这算怎么回事 女人也来评点国事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a thing it is, when women become such clerks,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.50,0:52:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还振振有词地教训一通\N{\fnArial\fs30}and what a comfort it will be to me in my old age.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.91,0:52:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}欺负朕年老力衰吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be lectured to by my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.52,0:52:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下无需受人教导\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty has no need to be taught by anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.96,0:52:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您的神学知识日益精进 远胜王公贵族\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your knowledge of divinity excels that of the princes.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.62,0:52:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}乃至教徒神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}and divines throughout the ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.60,0:52:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恕我直言 臣以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me, but I think it unseemly.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.97,0:53:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}身为臣民 不可与陛下如此争执\N{\fnArial\fs30}for any of your subjects to argue with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.04,0:53:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}王后也不能例外 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}as the Queen has just done. Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.74,0:53:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}曾有多少位高权重之人\N{\fnArial\fs30}many of the greatest subjects in the land.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.51,0:53:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为散播异端邪说\N{\fnArial\fs30}defending those same arguments that she does.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.14,0:53:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而被依法处死\N{\fnArial\fs30}have, by law, deserved death.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.53,0:53:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你没有证据 竟然就敢指控王后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot believe that you would accuse the Queen of heresy.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.36,0:53:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}散播邪说\N{\fnArial\fs30}without proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.14,0:53:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have the proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.60,0:53:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我需要陛下首肯\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what I need is Your Majesty's consent.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.90,0:53:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}许我草拟一份声讨王后的诉状\N{\fnArial\fs30}to draw up certain articles against the Queen,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.68,0:53:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如此才能依法审案\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that she may be put on trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.56,0:53:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让她受审吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}She could be put on trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.11,0:53:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是 朕要饶她不死\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet, I am fully resolved to spare her life.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.98,0:53:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.22,0:53:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如陛下所愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever Your Majesty desires.
